Copied without modification:

- src/components/ui/sidebar.tsx
- src/components/ui/separator.tsx
- src/components/ui/button.tsx
- src/components/ui/card.tsx
- src/components/ui/input.tsx
- src/components/ui/textarea.tsx
- src/components/ui/select.tsx
- src/components/ui/table.tsx
- src/components/ui/label.tsx
- src/components/ui/sheet.tsx
- src/components/ui/skeleton.tsx
- src/components/ui/tooltip.tsx
- src/hooks/use-mobile.ts

sheet.tsx, skeleton.tsx, tooltip.tsx, and use-mobile.ts are included because
sidebar.tsx imports them. select.tsx and sheet.tsx use the animation classes
from the same dashboard stylesheet.

src/app/globals.css keeps the default color tokens from the dashboard stylesheet.
Preset stylesheets, the font registry, landing-page rules, and print rules are not included.

The shell keeps SidebarProvider, AppSidebar, SidebarInset, SidebarTrigger, the header
separator, and a theme switcher from src/app/(main)/dashboard/layout.tsx.
Search, layout controls, the GitHub menu, AccountSwitcher, and src/data/users
are not included.

The research pages, API client, and relationship graph are not from that
repository.

